WEBVTT

00:02:30.063 --> 00:02:34.163
and what kind of relationship are you
establishing with your customers?

00:02:34.597 --> 00:02:39.430
And then, of course, how are you capturing
value with revenue streams?

00:02:40.163 --> 00:02:42.163
That's what I like to call
the front stage.

00:02:42.663 --> 00:02:45.230
Now, behind the curtain,
in the back stage,

00:02:45.563 --> 00:02:51.030
you describe the things you need to build
your business, the key resources,

00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:54.497
the assets you need to own to
build your business model,

00:02:54.497 --> 00:03:00.297
the key activities you need to be really
good at to create and deliver value.